flowchart TD
    Start([Admin opens Workbench]) --> SelectMedia{Select attachments}
    SelectMedia --> TriggerRecognition[Click Run Recognition]
    
    TriggerRecognition --> RecognitionRequest[POST /recognition/analyze]
    RecognitionRequest --> BackendAnalyze[Backend: /api/v0/analyze-scene]
    BackendAnalyze --> RecognitionPipeline[Face detection + roster matching]
    
    RecognitionPipeline --> PersistObs[Store observations in post_meta]
    PersistObs --> RefreshWorkbench[Workbench refreshes with results]
    
    RefreshWorkbench --> ReviewObs{Review observations?}
    ReviewObs -->|Yes| RosterManager[Open Roster Manager]
    ReviewObs -->|No| SelectMedia
    
    RosterManager --> ObservationPanel[View pending observations]
    ObservationPanel --> ResolveObs{Resolve observation}
    
    ResolveObs -->|Create new entry| CreateEntry[POST /roster]
    ResolveObs -->|Assign existing| AssignEntry[PATCH /observations/id]
    ResolveObs -->|Dismiss| DismissObs[Mark as dismissed]
    
    CreateEntry --> SyncBackend[Sync with backend roster]
    SyncBackend --> AutoAssign[Auto-assign matching observations]
    AutoAssign --> ObservationPanel
    
    AssignEntry --> ObservationPanel
    DismissObs --> ObservationPanel
    
    ObservationPanel --> Done([Observations resolved])

    note1["Recognition creates observations for unmatched faces.<br/>Operator resolves observations in Roster Manager.<br/>New roster entries auto-sync to backend."]
    RosterManager -.- note1
